          "text": "Témoignages: BOULOGNE-BILLANCOURT (92) 11.12.2023",
          "text_sha256": "c85888e4115b41881256dd4483ef6ff6b9ef3bb32bf6276ddbe1f747cc33a6b9"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
